<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Administrasi</div><h1>Pengaturan WhatsApp</h1><p>Bot verifikasi nomor untuk pendaftaran Setimbang. Modul kode manual tetap tersedia sebagai cadangan.</p></div></div>
<div class="wa-grid"><section class="card detail-card"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><div class="eyebrow">Koneksi bot</div><h2>Status WhatsApp</h2></div><span class="badge <?= !empty($engine_status['ok']) && ($engine_status['status'] ?? '')==='CONNECTED' ? 'success' : 'danger' ?>" id="wa-status"><?= e($engine_status['status'] ?? 'TIDAK TERHUBUNG') ?></span></div>
<p>Nomor tertaut: <strong id="wa-phone"><?= e($engine_status['phone'] ?? $wa_session->phone_number ?: '—') ?></strong></p>
<p class="muted small">Kode otomatis hanya dikirim saat bot aktif dan terhubung. Jika sambungan terputus, petugas dapat membuat kode manual dari profil pemohon.</p>
<div class="row-actions wa-actions"><form method="post" action="<?= site_url('petugas/whatsapp/kontrol') ?>"><?= form_hidden($this->security->get_csrf_token_name(),$this->security->get_csrf_hash()) ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="enable"><button class="button primary" type="submit">Aktifkan / sambungkan</button></form><form method="post" action="<?= site_url('petugas/whatsapp/kontrol') ?>"><?= form_hidden($this->security->get_csrf_token_name(),$this->security->get_csrf_hash()) ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="disable"><button class="button outline" type="submit">Nonaktifkan</button></form><form method="post" action="<?= site_url('petugas/whatsapp/kontrol') ?>" onsubmit="return confirm('Lepas nomor WhatsApp dan hapus sesi tautan?')"><?= form_hidden($this->security->get_csrf_token_name(),$this->security->get_csrf_hash()) ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="unlink"><button class="button outline" type="submit">Lepas nomor</button></form></div>
<div class="wa-qr-wrap"><div id="wa-qr" aria-label="Kode QR penautan WhatsApp"></div><p id="wa-qr-message" class="muted small">Buka WhatsApp di ponsel layanan → Perangkat tertaut → Tautkan perangkat. Scan QR ini setelah bot diaktifkan.</p><button class="button outline small-button" type="button" id="wa-refresh">Muat ulang QR</button></div></section>
<section class="card detail-card"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><div class="eyebrow">Isi pesan</div><h2>Template kode verifikasi</h2></div></div><form method="post" action="<?= site_url('petugas/whatsapp/template') ?>"><?= form_hidden($this->security->get_csrf_token_name(),$this->security->get_csrf_hash()) ?><label>Pesan WhatsApp<textarea name="otp_template" rows="5" maxlength="500" required><?= e($wa_settings->otp_template) ?></textarea></label><p class="muted small">Gunakan <code>{code}</code> tepat sekali. Kode berlaku 15 menit. Jangan menambahkan data pribadi lain ke pesan.</p><button class="button primary small-button" type="submit">Simpan template</button></form><div class="wa-info"><strong>Cadangan manual</strong><p>Di Data pemohon → Riwayat → Buat kode telepon, petugas tetap dapat membuat dan menyampaikan kode secara manual. Kode manual juga memakai batas lima kode per jam.</p></div></section></div>
<section class="card table-card admin-section"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><div class="eyebrow">Pemantauan</div><h2>Antrean kode terbaru</h2></div></div><?php if ($outbox): ?><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Waktu</th><th>Penerima</th><th>Status</th><th>Percobaan</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach ($outbox as $row): ?><tr><td data-label="Waktu"><?= e(tanggal_id($row->created_at,TRUE)) ?></td><td data-label="Penerima"><strong><?= e($row->full_name) ?></strong><small><?= e(substr($row->phone_number,0,4).'••••'.substr($row->phone_number,-3)) ?></small></td><td data-label="Status"><span class="badge <?= $row->status==='SENT'?'success':($row->status==='PENDING'?'info':'danger') ?>"><?= e($row->status) ?></span><?php if ($row->error_message): ?><small><?= e($row->error_message) ?></small><?php endif; ?></td><td data-label="Percobaan"><?= (int)$row->attempts ?></td><td data-label="Aksi"><?php if ($row->status==='FAILED'): ?><form method="post" action="<?= site_url('petugas/whatsapp/ulang/'.$row->id) ?>"><?= form_hidden($this->security->get_csrf_token_name(),$this->security->get_csrf_hash()) ?><button class="action-link" type="submit">Coba lagi</button></form><?php else: ?>—<?php endif; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><?php else: ?><div class="table-empty">Belum ada kode yang dikirim lewat WhatsApp.</div><?php endif; ?></section>
<script src="<?= base_url('assets/vendor/qrcodejs/qrcode.min.js') ?>" defer></script>
<script src="<?= base_url('assets/wa-settings.js?v=1') ?>" defer data-qr-url="<?= site_url('petugas/whatsapp/qr') ?>"></script>
<section class="card table-card admin-section"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><div class="eyebrow">Pemantauan</div><h2>Notifikasi SKHP dan penyelesaian</h2></div></div><?php if ($notifications): ?><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Waktu</th><th>Penerima</th><th>Status</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach ($notifications as $row): ?><tr><td><?= e(tanggal_id($row->created_at,TRUE)) ?></td><td><strong><?= e($row->full_name) ?></strong><small><?= e(substr($row->phone_number,0,4).'••••'.substr($row->phone_number,-3)) ?></small></td><td><span class="badge <?= $row->status==='SENT'?'success':($row->status==='PENDING'?'info':'danger') ?>"><?= e($row->status) ?></span><?php if ($row->error_message): ?><small><?= e($row->error_message) ?></small><?php endif; ?></td><td><?php if ($row->status==='FAILED'): ?><form method="post" action="<?= site_url('petugas/whatsapp/notifikasi/ulang/'.$row->id) ?>"><?= form_hidden($this->security->get_csrf_token_name(),$this->security->get_csrf_hash()) ?><button class="action-link" type="submit">Coba lagi</button></form><?php else: ?>—<?php endif; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><?php else: ?><div class="table-empty">Belum ada notifikasi WA layanan.</div><?php endif; ?></section>
